# Backend origin only, e.g. https://your-api.example.com (no /api suffix).
# Leave empty locally for the existing Vite /api and /uploads proxies.
# On Vercel, set the deployed backend origin then rebuild; Vite proxy is dev-only.
# If you already have Vercel API rewrites, keep them before the SPA fallback instead.
VITE_API_URL=
